WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:10.703
Birta á vef puts this stundatafla
on the public web page.

2
00:00:10.803 --> 00:00:16.705
Núverandi lausn, without teacher
names; updated at every Vista.

3
00:00:16.805 --> 00:00:20.707
Untick it to take the page down.

4
00:00:20.807 --> 00:00:25.708
Afrita copies a stundatafla –
e.g. to try something out.

5
00:00:25.808 --> 00:00:31.709
Eyða deletes it. The courses
and their sessions are untouched.

6
00:00:31.809 --> 00:00:47.320
Spoi → Skoða → Stundatafla kennara:
one teacher's week, every course.
